brand: CAPiTA
model name: Dark Horse
model year: 2027
AUD price: $949.99
availability status: Preorder
estimated availability: May 1, 2026
available sizes: 152cm, 154cm, 156cm, 158cm, 156cm Wide, 158cm Wide, 160cm Wide
board type: Freestyle
flex: 6/10
rider level: Intermediate
shape: Twin (symmetrical with identical tip and tail)
camber type: Park V1 (traditional camber transitioning to zero camber 4cm before end of sidecut for enhanced control while maintaining responsiveness)
sidecut type: Radial (single-radius design for consistent turn arc)
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
topsheet: Pearlescent Screen and Gloss/Matte Print (PAM16000 printing technology with 16,000 inkjet nozzles, solventless water-based UV ink, plus hand screen printing)
laminate: Special Blend Fiberglass (bi-axial fibreglass above and below core with structural additives)
laminate reinforcement: 2x30mm Carbon Aramid Boosters (carbon and aramid combination for power, responsiveness, high tensile strength, and impact resistance)
resin: Magic Bean Resin (plant-based, high bio-content, zero waste, no greenhouse emissions, low production temperatures, enhanced rigidity allows thinner wood core)
core: Dual Core (lightweight Poplar paired with Beech for enhanced power and durability)
base: Superdrive Base - Screen Print (combines sintered and extruded materials, built under higher pressure and temperature, tougher than traditional extruded)
board graphics note: Board graphics are size dependent and cannot be swapped between sizes
terrain: Park (jumps, rails, boxes)
riding characteristics: Energetic, lightweight, easy to press and butter
